  "body": "## What's changed\n\n- A SQL statement with a mistake deep inside nested parentheses or a long dotted name no longer freezes datui for minutes; a statement deeper than `limits.sql_depth` levels (24) is refused with the setting to raise\n- rustls 0.23.46, for RUSTSEC-2026-0346: `Debug` output of a TLS client session could expose its secrets\n"
